    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">So I was messing around with this problem some more, and the tech3 covariance matrix is available when adding &#39;TECH3 IS document.txt;&#39; to the SAVEDATA command line.  Then using model$results$tech3$paramCov.savedata the full covariance matrix is available, while model$results$tech3$paramCov is filled with NAs.<br></div>"
    ],
    [
